{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24005","headline":"早春雪後赠洛阳李长官长水郑明府二同年 · 白居易","name":"早春雪後赠洛阳李长官长水郑明府二同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"献岁晴和风景新，铜駞街郭暖无尘。\n府庭共贺三川雪，县道分行百里春。\n朱绂洛阳官位屈，青袍长水俸钱贫。\n有何功德纡金紫，若比同年是幸人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24005.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24005","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}